Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}The player who scored\N5 GOALS in 9 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Back in 2015,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:03.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Bayern Munich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:04.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}were playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:04.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Wolfsburg,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:05.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and Pep Guardiola
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}left Robert Lewandowski
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:07.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.21,0:00:07.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}By half-time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:08.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Bayern were losing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:09.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}1-0 at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:10.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}So Guardiola
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:11.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}sent Lewandowski on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Six minutes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:12.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he slid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:13.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in a goal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:14.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}from close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:14.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}58 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:15.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he scored
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:16.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}again from outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:16.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:17.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Two minutes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:17.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he hit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:18.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the post,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:18.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the keeper
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:19.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}saved the rebound,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and Lewandowski
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:20.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}smashed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:21.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in a third.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:21.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}That was the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:22.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}fastest hat-trick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:23.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in Bundesliga history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:23.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}three minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:24.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and 22 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:24.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}But he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:25.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}wasn't done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Two minutes later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:26.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he volleyed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:27.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in a fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:27.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Then came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}a fifth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.07,0:00:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}an acrobatic volley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:29.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Lewandowski said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.91,0:00:30.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}that after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:30.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}his fourth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:31.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}he looked up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:31.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}at the big screen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and just thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:32.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:33.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Five goals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:33.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in eight minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and 59 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:35.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Guardiola said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}that neither
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:36.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}as a player
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}nor as a coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:37.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}had he ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:38.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}seen anything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:38.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:39.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}And it almost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}got even crazier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:40.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:41.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:42.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Wolfsburg cleared one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:42.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}of his shots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}off the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:43.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}If it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:43.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}had gone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:43.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in, he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:44.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}would have equalled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:45.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the Bundesliga record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}of six goals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:46.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in one game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:47.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}set back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:48.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in 1977.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Bayern won 5-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:50.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}But here's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:50.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the wild part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:50.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}A few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:51.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}weeks later,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Guinness gave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:52.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Lewandowski four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:53.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}world records
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:54.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}for that one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:54.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}night:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the fastest hat-trick,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:55.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the fastest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:56.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}four goals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:56.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the fastest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:57.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}five goals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:57.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:58.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}most goals ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:00:59.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}by a substitute
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:00.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}in the Bundesliga.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:00.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}All from a player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:01.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}who started
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:01.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}the game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:02.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}on the bench.
